          {
            "title": "Question: Absolute",
            "id": 82333,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Wie positionieren wir ein Element in Bezug auf die Seiten einer Webseite?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>position: absolute;</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>display: absolute;</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>margin: absolute;</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>position: absolute;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Eine Benachrichtigung nutzt <code>position: relative; left: 10px;</code>. Sie soll stattdessen vom Seitenrand aus gemessen werden.</p><p>Welche Deklaration sollte <code>position: relative;</code> ersetzen?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>position: absolute;</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>position: relative;</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>display: absolute;</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>position: absolute;</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Out of flow",
            "id": 82335,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Welche Elemente werden aus dem normalen Fluss entfernt?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"css\" name=\"style.css\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"p\" class=\"selector-tag\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"position\" class=\"attribute\" /><text value=\": absolute;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"button\" class=\"selector-tag\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"margin\" class=\"attribute\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"5px\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>p</code>-Elemente</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>button</code>-Elemente</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>p</code> und <code>button</code> Elemente</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>p</code>-Elemente aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Du änderst nur die Absatzregel zu <code>position: relative</code>. Welches dieser Elemente wird dann aus dem normalen Fluss entfernt?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"css\" name=\"style.css\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"p\" class=\"selector-tag\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"position\" class=\"attribute\" /><text value=\": absolute;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"button\" class=\"selector-tag\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"margin\" class=\"attribute\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"5px\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Weder der Absatz noch der Button.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Nur der Absatz.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Nur der Button.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Weder der Absatz noch der Button.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
